## 3. dfit as the default SFX fitter

- `zrmd/audio/fit.py`: `fitter_name()`, `run_dfit()` (five stages: screen every source block alone, refit best singles plus pairs plus single with effect, grow the best chains by one block up to three, full settings on the four best chains plus the previous version's chain, then sixteen noise seeds on the winner), `score_window()`, and the previous recipe re-scored under the same window as `recipeBaseline` (kept if it scores higher, so a version never ships worse than before under the active score).
- `Scripts/ReproduceSound.py`: cuts each event's reference window from the stem it was detected on (analysis only), warm-starts from the best earlier chain and recipe, places the chain at the window start.
- Setting: `fit.fitter` in `datasets/sfx-params.json`, `"dfit"` by default; `--set fit.fitter="recipes"` restores the B1 path unchanged. Parameters of the stages live in `fit.sfxDfit` (screen, pair and full overrides, top counts, effects list, seeds).

